# StockKart UI kit & design

## Primitives

Use `@inventory-platform/ui-kit` (`Box`, `Stack`, `Text`, `Button`, `FormField`, `Link`, …). Avoid raw `<div>`, `<a>`, `<button>` when a primitive exists.

## Chrome (prefer over new CSS systems)

| Chrome | Use |
| ------ | --- |
| `shellChrome` | header, sidebar, notifications, help |
| `journeyChrome` | login/signup/onboarding |
| `chartChrome` | analytics; plots need `chartChrome.plot` (fixed height) |
| `productChrome` / `registrationChrome` | Scan Sell, registration |
| `accountingChrome` | ledger/journal |
| `surfaceChrome` | generic dashboard / profile surfaces |

## Buttons & forms

- In-app: `Button variant="solid"` — not `brand` (marketing only)
- Required: `FormField required` only — do **not** also put `*` in the label text

## UX

- Match existing StockKart chrome; no new purple-gradient / generic AI themes
- Soft borders + light elevation; avoid deep nested cards
- One purpose per section; keep step titles in sync with onboarding steps
- Tokens: prefer `--sk-*`

ui-kit must remain presentation-only (no fetch, no session).
